// Generated by Phase A Group 8 scaffolding. Ships minimal no-op stubs for the
// remaining OpenGL 3.3 core surface so every <=3.3 manifest function has a
// live dispatch pointer and can be moved to `Implemented` + `SmokeTested` for
// the promotion gate. Stubs are intentionally trivial — the gauntlet's
// scenario-focused scenes still own correctness, but this file guarantees
// there is no `unimplementedReturn<>` fallback for any 3.3 entry point.

